  "title": "ASCENT TETHER",
  "lines": [
   "The last of the world is the foot of this cable.",
   "The only way up is the road round it."
  ]
 },
 "outro": "The car climbs. The world becomes a curve, then a bright coin, then a thing you can hold in one hand.",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "start",
   "at": [10, 64],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "SIGNAL HOUSE",
   "text": "Calder, the Ascent Tether. The Vael freight goes up this cable and so do you. One road, round and round it. Nothing on it moves slowly except the loads."
  },
  {
   "id": "loads",
   "at": [35, 11],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "Orange on the deck, a shadow growing: that is where the next load lands. Thirty if it catches you. It will not catch anything that stays out of the light."
  },
  {
   "id": "crush",
   "at": [25, 52],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "They crush what they land on. All of it. Stand them under one."
  },
  {
   "id": "bay",
   "at": [19, 29],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "SIGNAL HOUSE",
   "text": "The freight bay. The car-call switch is on the wall. You will have to stand still for a moment to throw it."
  },
  {
